WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.590
The microwave background.

00:02.373 --> 00:08.570
This is the oldest light there is, released about 370 000 years after the Big Bang.

00:09.105 --> 00:13.860
The map is measured: a NASA spacecraft charted it across our whole sky.

00:14.393 --> 00:20.440
Painting it on this sphere, where the light set out, is an illustration; seen from anywhere else, it would differ.
